ElevenLabs Transcription for Valenced — 0.2.1

The v0.2 client adapter reuses the RowManager rendering and MESSAGE_UPDATE
refresh contracts from the examples message-logger/js/rows.ts and
message-link-preview/js/updates.ts; HTTP/Endpoints access inspired by
message-link-preview/js/fetch.ts. Community revision:
c398e3115f8a6ec5e1f5fa2dac9069c4b98b210c, GPL-3.0, Valenced contributors.
Forge/Anezium adaptations: persistent consents, bounds, refusal on
ambiguity, channel/message association and cleanup of the local rendering.
The sources of this preview are provided in the local archive
valenced-v020-technical-review-source.zip, not in the public v0.1.0 tag.

